<title>BRAZIL: Brazil markets closed Thursday for municipal vote.</title>
<headline>Brazil markets closed Thursday for municipal vote.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian financial markets will be closed on Thursday due to the first round of municipal elections.</p>
<p>Markets will reopen on Friday.</p>
<p>-- Sao Paulo newsroom, 55-11-2324411</p>
</text>
